<task id="051" project="spaarkeai-compose-r6">
  <metadata>
    <title>Documents surface version-history entry point (AllDocuments)</title>
    <phase>5 Documents version-history open UX (read-only)</phase>
    <gate>dep:050</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Frontend implementation modifying `.tsx` on a shared solution surface (`AllDocuments`), consuming a new authorization-bearing endpoint, with a new user-reachable entry point. CLAUDE.md §8 — code implementation + `.tsx` change + frontend tag → FULL; includes `&lt;ui-tests&gt;` with an ADR-021 dark-mode check.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>plan.md §5 Phase 5 assigns sonnet: well-specified UI affordance (list versions + open a prior version read-only) wired onto an existing endpoint (task 050) and the existing Documents list; no novel algorithm or architectural decision.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Touches the shared `AllDocuments` solution surface and the `Spaarke.Compose.Components` client family that overlaps `analysis-hub-r1` / `agreements-r1` / `spaarkeai-compose-r5`. Depends on task 050's endpoint contract → serialize after 050; run `/conflict-check` before the client PR.</parallel-reason>
